- op: discuss  # a343
  at: '2026-07-13T02:40:28Z'  # a343
  by: agent  # a343
  actor: jgstern_agent  # a343
  clock: 2  # a343
  nonce: a343  # a343
  message: "Filed as the explicit scope-out from ADR-0039 R3 (thread A). datamodels.py:377/394/397 dedups by confidence, mutates model.confidence via a centrality_boost, and sorts by confidence — the identical ranking-injected-into-confidence pattern that R3 relocated to rank_score for entrypoints/type_hierarchy. sketch.py:5433/6519-6521 sorts datamodels by confidence too. R3 names ONLY entrypoints + type_hierarchy, so extending mid-thread would have violated ADR scope; deferred here. Fix shape: add a DataModel.rank_score (or reuse the pattern), move centrality_boost + dedup + sort onto it, leaving DataModel.confidence as detection reliability — mirroring PR-4. Verify no consumer reads DataModel.confidence as a ranking value elsewhere first."  # a343
